title: "rsmodel: a resilience-symptom dynamical model of depression"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation and interactive companion of the resilience-symptom
  (RS) model, a qualitative two-state dynamical model of the interaction between
  depressive symptoms and psychological resilience under external adversity.
type: software
